# SPEC GOLDEN — hand-derived before the code existed, never regenerated. Two
# facts M9.9 has to get right that neither direction alone can show.
#
# Block 1 — a **row inside a column**. The outer column stretches its items to
#   its 40-cell content width, so the inner row is built at 40 and divides it
#   the way a row does: two items at `flex: 0 0 80px` = 10 cells, at x = 0 and
#   x = 10, and the row's own height is its line's cross size, 1. The column
#   then stacks it above "tail" at y = 0 and y = 1. A column item's cross size
#   is definite and its children may use it — that is what the inner row's 40
#   cells are.
#
# Block 2 — a **column inside a row**, and the case that fails silently if
#   intrinsic sizing and the engine disagree. The row asks the column how wide
#   it wants to be. A row's items sit side by side, so `intrinsic`'s flex
#   measurement is a *sum*; a column's sit on top of each other, so the width it
#   asks for is a **max** over its items — and no gap term, because the gap
#   between column items is a height and a `nowrap` column has one line, so no
#   cross gap falls between anything. max-content is max(4, 2) = 4, not 4+2 = 6.
#   Neither item can grow (`flex-grow` is 0), so the row hands the column
#   exactly 4 cells and "z" starts at x = 4. Summed, the column would have
#   measured 6 and pushed "z" two cells right — a bug invisible in the column
#   itself.
#
#   The column is then built at 4 cells, stretches both of its own items to 4,
#   and comes out 2 lines tall. The row's line is therefore 2, and `align-items`
#   is the initial `stretch`, so "z" — 1 line of content, `height: auto` — grows
#   to 2 as well. That last growth *is* a field write on a row item's height
#   (§9.4 step 11), which is why its line box is still 1 row at y = 2.
<html>  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=4
  <body>  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=4
    <div.col> flex column  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=2
      <div.row.cells> flex row  x=0 y=0 w=40 h=1
        <div>  x=0 y=0 w=10 h=1
          anonymous  x=0 y=0 w=10 h=1
            line  x=0 y=0 w=10 h=1
              #text "a"  x=0 y=0 w=1 h=1
        <div>  x=10 y=0 w=10 h=1
          anonymous  x=10 y=0 w=10 h=1
            line  x=10 y=0 w=10 h=1
              #text "b"  x=10 y=0 w=1 h=1
      <div>  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
        anonymous  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
          line  x=0 y=1 w=40 h=1
            #text "tail"  x=0 y=1 w=4 h=1
    <div.row> flex row  x=0 y=2 w=40 h=2
      <div.col> flex column  x=0 y=2 w=4 h=2
        <div>  x=0 y=2 w=4 h=1
          anonymous  x=0 y=2 w=4 h=1
            line  x=0 y=2 w=4 h=1
              #text "aaaa"  x=0 y=2 w=4 h=1
        <div>  x=0 y=3 w=4 h=1
          anonymous  x=0 y=3 w=4 h=1
            line  x=0 y=3 w=4 h=1
              #text "bb"  x=0 y=3 w=2 h=1
      <div>  x=4 y=2 w=1 h=2
        anonymous  x=4 y=2 w=1 h=1
          line  x=4 y=2 w=1 h=1
            #text "z"  x=4 y=2 w=1 h=1
